WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:02.009
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.009 --> 00:00:05.381
- I'm Jan Kingaard, CEO of
King Size Bows Incorporated,

00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:07.881
and welcome to my bow kingdom.

00:00:10.505 --> 00:00:11.867
We're in the joy business.

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:15.088
We make special occasions special.

00:00:15.088 --> 00:00:16.907
I have to say that our most popular bow

00:00:16.907 --> 00:00:21.074
is our signature monarch
bow, the red and silver one.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.977
The Lexus commercials, that
we've had the privilege of doing

00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:26.245
for the last eight years,

00:00:26.245 --> 00:00:30.288
has really drawn attention
to the multi-loop bows.

00:00:30.288 --> 00:00:32.313
We're the only ones in the United States

00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:34.730
who actually make those bows.

00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:38.897
We make them out of a variety
of fabrics and textures,

00:00:38.897 --> 00:00:43.391
and those are the ones that
people are most interested in.

00:00:43.391 --> 00:00:46.559
There's a whole bow language
that most people don't speak,

00:00:46.559 --> 00:00:48.799
but there are definitely
differences of opinions

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:51.651
about how many loops, how
long the tails should be,

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:55.401
and whether there's a
V-cut or an angled cut.

00:00:56.747 --> 00:01:00.018
We are pleased to be on
every showroom from Ferrari,

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:02.435
to the Mini, to the Ford, to BMW.

00:01:04.307 --> 00:01:07.050
Now, we've found that
customers really expect to keep

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.795
the bow when they buy the car.

00:01:09.795 --> 00:01:12.618
They wanna drive away with the bow.

00:01:12.618 --> 00:01:14.998
You'd be surprised where people put bows,

00:01:14.998 --> 00:01:17.728
it's not just on top of a car.

00:01:17.728 --> 00:01:21.419
Any place that you wanna
say, look at me, look at me.

00:01:21.419 --> 00:01:24.094
It can be on a bicycle,
or a surf board, or skis,

00:01:24.094 --> 00:01:28.844
on a gate, on the top of
your house at a pinnacle.

00:01:28.844 --> 00:01:32.261
Once you put a bow on it, it's a present.

